#. Tag: title
#: entities.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working With &XML; Data Files (Entities)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: entities.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the inspector dialog is not showing use the <menuchoice> <guimenu>Tools</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show inspectors</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> menu item. "
"To work with entities click on the <guilabel>Entities</guilabel> tab of "
"dialog shown."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: entities.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All external &XML; entities included via the DATA file or one of its "
"siblings are listed here. For this example I have run &kxsldbg; on "
"<filename>testdoc.xsl</filename> with <filename>testdoc.xml</filename> "
"(found in the <filename role=\"directory\">&lt;KDE PREFIX&gt;/share/apps/"
"kxsldbg</filename> folder so that you can see some entities."
msgstr ""

